      "text": "CONTEXT:\n    The geographic frontiers were closed by the early 20th century.\n    Every coastline mapped. Every continent crossed.\n    Poles reached. Highest peaks summited.\n    The remaining frontiers: vertical (space, deep ocean), and speed."
