      "text": "TIMELINE:\n  1931 ─── PICCARD (Auguste): Stratosphere. First to 15,781m in balloon.\n  1932 ─── PICCARD (Auguste): 16,201m. Cosmic ray research.\n  1961 ─── GAGARIN: First human in space. Vostok 1. 108 minutes.\n  1962 ─── GLENN: First American to orbit Earth. Friendship 7.\n  1969 ─── ARMSTRONG+ALDRIN: First humans on the Moon. Apollo 11.\n  1960 ─── PICCARD (Jacques)+WALSH: Mariana Trench. 10,916m. (See Ch.08)\n  1985 ─── BALLARD: Titanic discovered. Debris field at 3,800m depth.\n  1986 ─── BALLARD: Bismarck discovered.\n  1989 ─── BALLARD: USS Yorktown discovered (WWII carrier).\n  2012 ─── CAMERON: Solo descent to Challenger Deep. (James Cameron)\n  2019 ─── VESCOVO: Deepest crewed dive. 10,928m. Challenger Deep."
